        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% States\n    Start((Start))\n    WaitState[Input Waiting State]\n    CountState[Countdown State]\n    Delay[Delay Loop]\n\n    %% I/O Actions\n    ReadSW[/Read Switches/]\n    WriteLED[/Write to LEDs/]\n    ReadRST[/Read Reset Button/]\n\n    %% Start Logic\n    Start --&gt; WaitState\n    \n    %% Wait State Logic\n    WaitState --&gt; ReadSW\n    ReadSW --&gt; CheckSW{Switch != 0?}\n    CheckSW -- No --&gt; WaitState\n    CheckSW -- Yes --&gt; Capture[Capture Switch Value]\n    Capture --&gt; CountState\n\n    %% Countdown State Logic\n    CountState --&gt; WriteLED\n    WriteLED --&gt; ReadRST\n    ReadRST --&gt; CheckRST{Reset == 1?}\n    \n    %% Reset behavior\n    CheckRST -- Yes --&gt; Clear[Clear Counter &amp; LEDs]\n    Clear --&gt; WaitState\n\n    %% Delay and Decrement\n    CheckRST -- No --&gt; Delay\n    Delay --&gt; Decrement[Decrement Counter]\n    Decrement --&gt; CheckZero{Counter == 0?}\n    \n    %% Loop or Exit\n    CheckZero -- No --&gt; CountState\n    CheckZero -- Yes --&gt; WaitState&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="HKyqghaTdFQBJDtvVWuN-1">
